From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:06:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 21: album management

- Move to album / Copy to album from the selection bar's More menu (also holds Lock)
- Album picker sheet with a New album option and name validation
- Rename album from a long-press in the Albums tab
- Moves use MediaStore write requests (system confirmation) then change the folder; copies create new entries
- AlbumPaths rules (allowed folders, sanitising names, renaming) with tests
- README updated
